    <briefdescription>
<para>Fetches all pages from a JSON/REST API endpoint. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Handles page-based, cursor-based, and offset-based pagination automatically. For GraphQL endpoints the caller supplies a POST body_template with the query; {{QUERY}}, {{PAGE}}, and {{CURSOR}} placeholders are substituted. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
